closed-source services, or SaaS offerings requires a valid commercial license from
the copyright holder.

To request a commercial license, contact: zkalamgir@proton.me

4. CONTRIBUTIONS & ZERO-DEPENDENCY GUARANTEE:
All contributions to this repository and standard libraries must be written in
100% pure Cluster without external C/C++ third-party library dependencies, ensuring
deterministic standalone portability across x86-64, ARM, and embedded architectures.

